This is a planning pass only, so I made no edits. The request type and its stored form are in `reef/core/evaluation.py`, which holds `task_names` and the settings parsing. The queue admission and the `waiting` state fall in `reef/service/artifact_evaluations.py`, which `accept` and `rollouts_json` belong to. The queue itself is in `reef/storage/work_queue.py`, with its SQL implementation in `reef/storage/sql_coordination.py`. `reef/storage/evaluations.py` also matched the `task_names` search, so it likely holds the stored request.

I did not read the full bodies of the storage files, so their exact edit points are unconfirmed. The `waiting` state may also touch `reef/evaluation/rollout_worker.py`, which I left out of the list.

